# The headers on every file the site serves; the Worker's own answers under /api/ set theirs in code.
# The CSP allows the site's own files (the home page's video pictures among them, copied to the site and served
# from /thumbs/), its own frames (a page saved into a thread, sealed by its own answer's headers), the note flow's
# scripts and Cloudflare's Turnstile (its script and its frame), and requests only to the site itself.
# Fonts come only from the site itself (site/fonts/), never from a font host.
# No page may use the camera, the microphone or the location.
# The referrer policy is never no-referrer: strict-origin-when-cross-origin tells a site a reader leaves for that
# they came from donepudi.me, and never which page.
# test/site.test.ts checks this file against the pages and the scripts.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'none'; script-src 'self' https://challenges.cloudflare.com; style-src 'self'; img-src 'self'; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self'; frame-src 'self' https://challenges.cloudflare.com; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
